# 系统文件
.DS_Store

# 私有账户资料与研究原始材料：仅本机保存，不推送
investment-hq/data/snapshots/*
!investment-hq/data/snapshots/.gitkeep
research/20261024-evidence-completion/private/
research/20261024-evidence-completion/sources/
research/20261024-all-pool-repricing/

# 运行产物与临时文件
# 注意：archive/（历史归档）与 evidence/（研究证据）是有意入库的，勿加入忽略列表
tmp/
logs/
investment-platform/node_modules/
investment-platform/server.log
investment-platform/sync.log
investment-platform/divcache.json
investment-platform/config.json.backup*
investment-platform/*.pending
investment-platform/*.tmp-*
*.aigc-tmp

# 约定：invest-miniprogram/utils/config.js 与 snapshot.js 按"git 备份纪律"保留跟踪，
